OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785887271
OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FOne in eight mothers in England are
OL,8,Fdiagnosed with diabetes while
OL,9,Fpregnant, according to new analysis.
OL,11,FThe estimate represents "a relative
OL,12,Fincrease of 60% in five years", with a
OL,13,Fsharp rise in cases among women of
OL,14,Fcolour and those living in deprived
OL,15,Fareas.
OL,17,FGestational diabetes (GD) "should be
OL,18,Frecognised as a vulnerability in the
OL,19,Fhealthcare system" that affects the
OL,20,Fwellbeing of mothers and babies,
OL,21,Fresearchers said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
