OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FGD happens when women cannot produce
OL,8,Fenough insulin while pregnant, leading
OL,9,Fto high blood sugar.
OL,11,FWhile the condition usually disappears
OL,12,Fafter birth, patients face a higher
OL,13,Frisk of going on to develop type 2
OL,14,Fdiabetes.
OL,16,FIt can also cause babies to grow
OL,17,Flarger than normal, cause low blood
OL,18,Fsugar in newborns and put women at
OL,19,Fhigher risk of pre-eclampsia.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
