PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785887271
OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FA new study by researchers at the
OL,8,FUniversity of Edinburgh analysed five
OL,9,Fyears of hospital care data in England.
OL,11,FIt included more than two million
OL,12,Fwomen who gave birth to 2.8 million
OL,13,Fbabies across 184 hospitals between
OL,14,F2018 and 2022.
OL,16,FIt found one in eight was diagnosed
OL,17,Fwith GD, compared to one in 12 in 2018.
OL,19,FThe estimate suggests "a relative
OL,20,Fincrease of 60% in five years",
OL,21,Fresearchers said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
