OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785887271
OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FThe rise in cases was highest among
OL,8,Fwomen of colour ` 23% among Asian
OL,9,Fwomen ` as well as among those living
OL,10,Fin deprivation (14%).
OL,12,FResearchers said: "In 2022, two in
OL,13,Fevery 21 white mothers received a
OL,14,Fdiagnosis of gestational diabetes; for
OL,15,Fblack mothers, the rate was two in
OL,16,Fevery 13, and for Asian mothers, two
OL,17,Fin every nine."
OL,19,FThese women also faced a higher risk
OL,20,Fof complications.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
