OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785887271
OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FFor example, deprived women were 29%
OL,8,Fmore likely to have a pre-term birth,
OL,9,Fwhile black mothers had 36% higher
OL,10,Fodds of having an emergency Caesarean.
OL,12,FAsian women were also more than twice
OL,13,Fas likely to have a small baby.
