OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785887271
OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FResearchers said: "The substantial
OL,8,Fincrease in the incidence of
OL,9,Fgestational diabetes should be
OL,10,Frecognised as a vulnerability in the
OL,11,Fhealthcare system, affecting the
OL,12,Fwellbeing of mothers and their
OL,13,Fchildren.
OL,15,F"Health policy must ensure that
OL,16,Fantenatal clinics can sustain the
OL,17,Fburden of this increased caseload and
OL,18,Fprovide adequate care to women with a
OL,19,Fdiagnosis of gestational diabetes."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
