PN,31707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1785887271
OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,FRebecca Reynolds, professor of
OL,8,Fmetabolic medicine at the University
OL,9,Fof Edinburgh, said: "This the first
OL,10,Ftime we have managed to estimate the
OL,11,Fnumber of women with gestational
OL,12,Fdiabetes in the UK.
OL,14,F"The rising number of women being
OL,15,Fdiagnosed is concerning and impacts on
OL,16,Fmaternity services delivery which are
OL,17,Falready challenged.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
