OL,3,COne in eight mothers diagnosed with
OL,4,Cdiabetes while pregnant, new analysis
OL,5,Cshows
OL,7,F"Importantly, gestational diabetes
OL,8,Falso increases risk of future type 2
OL,9,Fdiabetes and cardiovascular disease,
OL,10,Fso better preventative measures are
OL,11,Fneeded to help support these women
OL,12,Fpost-partum."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
